  abilityDesc: 20 combo Earth attack on all foes (damage relative to remaining HP),
    5 combo Earth attack on single foe (or probable 5% damage of foes' max HP), probable
    spark critical for 3 turns, spark damage fills BB gauge for 3 turns, boosts spark
    damage (Earth) for 3 turns & fills OD gauge
